[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0010","text":"（哦，是凛世……一个人在那儿做什么呢？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0020","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0030","text":"凛世。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0040","text":"——制作人阁下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0050","text":"在这种地方做什么呢？在想事情吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0060","text":"不……那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0070","text":"如果你愿意说的话，能跟我讲讲吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0080","text":"…………\n……好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0090","text":"故乡的事……忽然间……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0100","text":"────\n实在惭愧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0110","text":"不知为何……总是……不由自主地想起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0120","text":"……是吗。那就────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0130","text":"────喂——……！\n……哈哈，要不要试着大声喊出来？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0140","text":"说不定能传到远方的家人那里呢。乘着风，去吧────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0150","text":"呵呵……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0160","text":"————喂——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0170","text":"……有回应……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0180","text":"……嗯，我也听到了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01011200_02_0004","text":"Motion"}]
